    "claude-code": "Open this folder in Claude Code (`claude`) or start a Claude app / web Code session on this repo, then type  /kickoff  (you already have product docs)  /start  (new idea)  /build-my-team  /status. Ask for a role by name: \"use the architect subagent\". In Claude Code on the web or the Claude app, select this repo for the session - the same files load.",
